{"id":27948,"slug":"poto-and-cabengo","title":"Poto and Cabengo","year":1980,"country":"United States","duration":73,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27948-poto-and-cabengo","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/0099090e6cf64df4af07af286d0ed594/Bsn528tPJBHoa2i7ivX1JtTa8bvsMJ_large.jpg","description":"Grace and Virginia are young San Diego twins who speak unlike anyone else. With little exposure to the outside world, the two girls have created a private form of communication that’s an amalgam of the distinctive English dialects they hear at home. Jean-Pierre Gorin’s polyphonic nonfiction investigation of this phenomenon looks at the family from a variety of angles, with the director taking on the role of a sort of sociological detective. It’s a delightful and absorbing study of words and faces, mass media and personal isolation, and America’s odd margins.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jean-Pierre Gorin","slug":"jean-pierre-gorin"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Grace Kennedy","role":"Featuring","slug":"grace-kennedy"},{"actor":"Virginia Kennedy","role":null,"slug":"virginia-kennedy"},{"actor":"Tom Kennedy","role":null,"slug":"tom-kennedy"},{"actor":"Christine Kennedy","role":null,"slug":"christine-kennedy"},{"actor":"Paula Künert","role":null,"slug":"paula-kunert"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Jean-Pierre Gorin","slug":"jean-pierre-gorin"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Zweites Deutsches Fernsehen","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Jean-Pierre Gorin","slug":"jean-pierre-gorin"},{"role":"Narrator","person":"Jean-Pierre Gorin","slug":"jean-pierre-gorin"},{"role":"Additional narration","person":"Sheila Sharp","slug":null},{"role":"Additional narration","person":"Hans Teuchart","slug":null},{"role":"Camera","person":"Les Blank","slug":"les-blank"},{"role":"Camera assistant","person":"Greg Durbin","slug":null},{"role":"Still photography","person":"Maureen Gosling","slug":null},{"role":"Still photography